<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="my-project">My Project</h2>
<p>To start work on my project, I did a few things to show off my analysis and data skills. First, I found some data online and imported it into a database schema. <img src="https://your-website-url.example.com/posts/firstpost/Screenshot 2026-03-04 at 4.48.56 PM.png" class="img-fluid"></p>
<p>As I work further on this, I will improve the organization of the data, to structure it appropriately and effeciently.</p>
<p>Then, I imported it into r and did prelimenary analysis, looking for useful insights. <img src="https://your-website-url.example.com/posts/firstpost/Screenshot 2026-03-04 at 4.33.34 PM.png" class="img-fluid"></p>


